<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>The two week pilot | Termstack</title>
<meta name="description" content="Two weeks to understand your practice and evaluate whether the platform model fits." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#FFFFFF;
    --ink:#16181C;
    --muted:#6A6F76;
    --line:#E4E3DE;
    --accent:#2B4ED6;
    --red:#D02B2B;
    --display:"Schibsted Grotesk",system-ui,sans-serif;
    --body:"Schibsted Grotesk",system-ui,sans-serif;
    --gutter:clamp(20px,5vw,72px);
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);
    font-family:var(--body);font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:100vh;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;text-rendering:optimizeLegibility;
  }
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  ::selection{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;}

  .mark{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;line-height:0.88;letter-spacing:-0.045em;margin:0;}

  .top{
    display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;
    padding:clamp(28px,4vw,48px) var(--gutter) 0;
  }
  .wordmark{font-size:17px;line-height:1.2;}
  .dot{color:var(--red);}
  .back{color:var(--muted);padding-top:1px;white-space:nowrap;transition:color .2s;}
  .back:hover{color:var(--ink);}

  .intro{padding:clamp(56px,9vw,110px) var(--gutter) clamp(40px,6vw,64px);}
  .intro h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,7.5vw,6rem);max-width:14ch;text-transform:uppercase;}
  .intro p{margin:clamp(26px,3.6vw,40px) 0 0;line-height:1.45;max-width:clamp(46ch,58vw,76ch);color:var(--muted);}
  .intro p+p{margin-top:1.1em;}

  .sec{padding:0 var(--gutter) clamp(40px,6vw,72px);}
  .sec-label{
    padding:clamp(34px,4.5vw,56px) 0 clamp(18px,2.4vw,28px);
    font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .row{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.5fr);
    gap:clamp(16px,4vw,56px);
    padding:clamp(24px,3vw,36px) 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .sec .row:last-of-type{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .row h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;margin:0;line-height:1.3;font-size:17px;}
  .row .stage{color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;display:block;margin-top:4px;}
  .row p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);max-width:clamp(46ch,52vw,72ch);}
  .row p+p{margin-top:1.1em;}
  .row ul{margin:16px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;}
  .row li{color:var(--muted);padding:6px 0 6px 30px;position:relative;max-width:clamp(46ch,52vw,72ch);}
  .row li::before{
    content:"";position:absolute;left:2px;top:13px;
    width:6px;height:11px;
    border-right:1.5px solid var(--ink);
    border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--ink);
    transform:rotate(42deg);
  }

  .close{padding:clamp(56px,8vw,96px) var(--gutter);border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
  .close h2{font-size:17px;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.3;}
  .close-note{margin:clamp(18px,2.4vw,26px) 0 0;color:var(--muted);max-width:clamp(42ch,50vw,68ch);}
  .close .actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(16px,2.5vw,28px);flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:clamp(26px,3.6vw,40px);}
  .book{
    font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;
    background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:15px 28px;transition:background .2s;
  }
  .book:hover{background:var(--accent);}
  .mailto{color:var(--muted);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:2px;transition:color .2s,border-color .2s;}
  .mailto:hover{color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);}

  footer{padding:0 var(--gutter);margin-top:auto;}
  .foot-bar{
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 0;
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;
    color:var(--muted);
  }
  .foot-bar a{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:2px;transition:color .2s,border-color .2s;}
  .foot-bar a:hover{color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);}

  @media(max-width:760px){
    .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;}
    .intro h1{max-width:none;}
  }
  a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px;}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;}}
</style>
</head>
<body id="top">

<header class="top">
  <a href="index.html" class="mark wordmark">TERMSTACK<span class="dot">.</span></a>
  <a href="index.html" class="back">&larr; Home</a>
</header>

<section class="intro">
  <h1 class="mark">The two week pilot.</h1>
  <p>Two weeks to understand your practice properly, and to find out whether the platform model is right for you.</p>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="sec-label">How it runs</div>

  <div class="row">
    <h2>Every day<span class="stage">Ten working days</span></h2>
    <div>
      <p>We meet daily. Not a kickoff and a report, but a standing conversation, because what matters about a practice rarely comes out in the first meeting.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row">
    <h2>Sprints<span class="stage">3 to 4 days</span></h2>
    <div>
      <p>We take a priority project and work it end to end, so the two weeks produce something real rather than only a picture of the firm.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row">
    <h2>The strategy call<span class="stage">End of week two</span></h2>
    <div>
      <p>We sit down with everything we have learned and evaluate whether the platform model fits your practice. If it does not, we say so.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="sec-label">What we cover</div>

  <div class="row">
    <h2>Your practice</h2>
    <div>
      <p>How the firm actually works. Where your time goes, what you do yourself that you should not, and what you are protecting.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row">
    <h2>Current matters</h2>
    <div>
      <p>The live book. What is open, how it is being run, and where the operational drag sits.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row">
    <h2>Pipeline</h2>
    <div>
      <p>What is coming in, where it comes from, and what happens to an inquiry between arriving and becoming a matter.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row">
    <h2>Marketing strategy</h2>
    <div>
      <p>A plan for which events, groups, and organizations you should participate in. We accomplish a top priority project.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row">
    <h2>Artifacts</h2>
    <div>
      <p>You walk away with external materials for RFPs, event applications, and for your referral network.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="close">
  <h2 class="mark">Start with two weeks.</h2>
  <p class="close-note">Reach out if you are building your own practice, or growing the one you have.</p>
  <div class="actions">
    <a class="book" href="https://calendly.com/marissa-termstack/30min" target="_blank">Book a call</a>
    <a class="mailto" href="mailto:marissa@termstack.ai">marissa@termstack.ai</a>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="foot-bar">
    <span>&copy; 2026 Termstack. All rights reserved.</span>
